<title>FRANCE: Hoechst sets dates for Roussel offer.</title>
<headline>Hoechst sets dates for Roussel offer.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals giant Hoechst said its tender offer for French pharmaceutical company Roussel Uclaf would run from December 20 to January 24, 1997, inclusive.</p>
<p>Hoechst, which holds 57 percent of Roussel Uclaf, announced earlier this month an 18.1 billion franc offer to buy out minority shareholders.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
